# --- Change Summary ---------------------------------------------------------
# What was changed: Added native project directories android/ and ios/ to the ignore list so platform builds stay out of Git history.
# Why it was changed: Prevent accidental commits of large platform scaffolding that should be regenerated locally.
# Dependencies or related files: Relies on Expo/React Native tooling recreating these folders as needed.
# MCP Context 7: Implementation follows MCP context 7 best practices for clean repos and predictable CI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
